e interaction. If these two requirements are met, the color of the wolf's collar can be changed. The game doesn't check if the player carrying out the interaction is the wolf's owner before allowing the color of its collar to be changed, therefore resulting in this problem occurring."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fix:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Simply altering the appropriate existing \"if\" statement within this piece of code to check if the player carrying out the interaction is the wolf's owner before allowing the color of its collar to be changed will resolve this problem."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Current \"if\" statement:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"java"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"if (dyecolor != this.getCollarColor())"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixed \"if\" statement:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"java"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"if (dyecolor != this.getCollarColor() && this.isOwnedBy(player))"}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10023","value":"Confirmed","id":"10023"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/version/10518","id":"10518","name":"23w12a","archived":true,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2023-03-21"}],"customfield_10055":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10058","value":"Items","id":"10058"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10065","value":"Mob behaviour","id":"10065"}],"resolution":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/resolution/10004","id":"10004","description":"A fix for this issue is checked into the tree and tested.","name":"Fixed"},"customfield_10047":"2020-10-01T16:58:00.000-0700","customfield_10048":null,"labels":["wolf"],"customfield_10049":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10079","value":"Normal","id":"10079"},"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/125003","id":"125003","filename":"MC-197241.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/32"},"displayName":"Avoma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2021-02-28T09:18:31.284-0800","size":3135257,"mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/125003"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/125004","id":"125004","filename":"MC-197241 - Current Code.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/32"},"displayName"